    "inheritance.campaign.description": "A village property dispute across evidence, neighbours, police, lawyers, court, settlement, and aftermath.",
    "inheritance.campaign.title": "Inheritance",
    "inheritance.ending_abandonment.text": "The House Without an Heir\n\nYou walk away. Grass crosses the disputed line before any relative does.",
    "inheritance.ending_buyout.text": "One Owner, Five Receipts\n\nYou buy the remaining shares and inherit the roof, the tomatoes, and all future advice.",
    "inheritance.ending_court_victory.text": "The Court Record\n\nThe judgment settles ownership in twelve pages. Nobody reads the same emotional result.",
    "inheritance.ending_family_peace.text": "The Table After Court\n\nYou use the archivist's note to offer dignity with the facts. Lunch becomes possible again.",
    "inheritance.ending_family_war.text": "The Inheritance War\n\nThe police report keeps the facts straight while the family perfects every other kind of damage.",
    "inheritance.ending_settlement.text": "The Village Settlement\n\nThe signatures do not create affection, but they create a boundary everyone can live beside.",
    "inheritance.neighbour_route_1.listen": "Write down the useful dates",
    "inheritance.neighbour_route_1.push": "Let the 1994 story run its course",
    "inheritance.neighbour_route_1.text": "Your mother supplies names, dates, and a detailed account of who failed to bring salad in 1994.",
    "inheritance.neighbour_route_2.improvise": "Negotiate with the calmest branch first",
    "inheritance.neighbour_route_2.prepare": "Invite every co-owner to mediation",
    "inheritance.neighbour_route_2.text": "The oldest neighbour remembers the boundary before the fence and the agreement before the argument.",
    "inheritance.neighbour_route_3.favour": "Call in the favour you earned",
    "inheritance.neighbour_route_3.favour_fail": "No one owes you that favour yet.",
    "inheritance.neighbour_route_3.steady": "Use what you prepared",
    "inheritance.neighbour_route_3.text": "A village meeting turns testimony into negotiation while coffee keeps everyone technically seated.",
    "inheritance.neighbour_route_4.ending_buyout": "One Owner, Five Receipts",
    "inheritance.neighbour_route_4.ending_settlement": "The Village Settlement",
    "inheritance.neighbour_route_4.text": "The family can now settle, trade shares, or preserve the dispute as its most durable tradition.",
    "inheritance.neighbour_route_event_1.text": "The day contributes its own amendment.",
    "inheritance.neighbour_route_event_1a.proceed": "Record the neighbour's boundary account",
    "inheritance.neighbour_route_event_1a.text": "A forgotten photograph dates the old fence and includes everyone smiling beside it.",
    "inheritance.neighbour_route_event_1b.proceed": "Measure the fence before listening",
    "inheritance.neighbour_route_event_1b.text": "The story expands to include a christening and loses the parcel entirely.",
    "inheritance.neighbour_route_event_2.text": "A seeded interruption arrives on schedule.",
    "inheritance.neighbour_route_event_2a.proceed": "Draft a shared-use agreement",
    "inheritance.neighbour_route_event_2a.text": "Two co-owners arrive ready to settle because the bus home leaves at four.",
    "inheritance.neighbour_route_event_2b.proceed": "Offer to buy the smallest shares",
    "inheritance.neighbour_route_event_2b.text": "A cousin arrives late with a secret agreement written on hotel stationery.",
    "inheritance.police_route_1.listen": "Call police before entering",
    "inheritance.police_route_1.push": "Enter and explain later",
    "inheritance.police_route_1.text": "The new padlock yields immediately. The family WhatsApp group achieves operational readiness seconds later.",
    "inheritance.police_route_2.improvise": "Start fixing the roof immediately",
    "inheritance.police_route_2.prepare": "Document every repair and defect",
    "inheritance.police_route_2.text": "Police record the fence, the lock, the missing deeds, and six mutually exclusive versions of a Tuesday.",
    "inheritance.police_route_3.favour": "Call in the favour you earned",
    "inheritance.police_route_3.favour_fail": "No one owes you that favour yet.",
    "inheritance.police_route_3.steady": "Use what you prepared",
    "inheritance.police_route_3.text": "Property condition becomes evidence: broken windows, repaired roof, cultivated tomatoes, and one room nobody claims.",
    "inheritance.police_route_4.ending_abandonment": "The House Without an Heir",
    "inheritance.police_route_4.ending_family_war": "The Inheritance War",
    "inheritance.police_route_4.text": "The report prevents invention but not anger. You must choose whether the house is worth the war it now documents.",
    "inheritance.police_route_event_1.text": "The day contributes its own amendment.",
    "inheritance.police_route_event_1a.proceed": "Keep the report number",
    "inheritance.police_route_event_1a.text": "The responding officer recognizes the parcel from an older boundary complaint and finds its diagram.",
    "inheritance.police_route_event_1b.proceed": "Argue that family matters need no report",
    "inheritance.police_route_event_1b.text": "A cousin removes the cut lock and replaces it with a larger one before sunset.",
    "inheritance.police_route_event_2.text": "A seeded interruption arrives on schedule.",
    "inheritance.police_route_event_2a.proceed": "Offer the property to the other branch",
    "inheritance.police_route_event_2a.text": "The damp wall reveals an older doorway matching the deed plan.",
    "inheritance.police_route_event_2b.proceed": "Prepare for a final confrontation",
    "inheritance.police_route_event_2b.text": "A storm damages the roof and makes every negotiating position more expensive.",
    "inheritance.property_inheritance.choice_accept_tomato_logic": "Hear the neighbours before challenging tomato law",
    "inheritance.property_inheritance.choice_call_mother": "Ask family and neighbours what happened",
    "inheritance.property_inheritance.choice_consult_lawyer": "Take the papers directly to a lawyer",
    "inheritance.property_inheritance.choice_cut_padlock": "Cut the padlock and force the issue",
    "inheritance.property_inheritance.choice_request_records": "Find the old documents",
    "inheritance.property_inheritance.text": "Your aunt says she owns the entire property because she has maintained the tomatoes since 1998. The news arrives with one missing deed and five confident relatives.",
    "inheritance.records_route_1.listen": "Let the archivist explain the annotations",
    "inheritance.records_route_1.push": "Photograph everything before lunch",
    "inheritance.records_route_1.text": "The cadastral archive holds three plans: old, older, and the one everyone cites but nobody can unfold.",
    "inheritance.records_route_2.improvise": "Lead with the oldest deed",
    "inheritance.records_route_2.prepare": "Build a dated evidence folder",
    "inheritance.records_route_2.text": "A lost deed surfaces in a municipal index under your grandfather's second spelling.",
    "inheritance.records_route_3.favour": "Call in the favour you earned",
    "inheritance.records_route_3.favour_fail": "No one owes you that favour yet.",
    "inheritance.records_route_3.steady": "Use what you prepared",
    "inheritance.records_route_3.text": "The lawyer compares signatures while the family compares memories, neither exercise producing silence.",
